# PC card team-counters (docs/plan-team-top5.md section 11, TMODE-20..24, BENCH-123): bb (A/A) against aa on every team a screen plays, the screens' seeds. Template: tcprep writes work/team-counters-sbb.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml
--team
true
--seeds
16
--seed-base
4600
--rounds
10
--parallel
auto
--child-heap
2G
--cpu-constant
auto
--set
work/team-counters-all.txt
--robot-jar
bisect/hadur2.HadurTeam_@V@bb.jar
--robot
hadur2.HadurTeam @V@bb
--member
hadur2.Hadur
--out
work/team-counters-@V@-sbb
--report
../docs/bench/local/team-counters-sbb.md
--baseline
bisect/hadur2.HadurTeam_@V@aa.jar
--baseline-robot
hadur2.HadurTeam @V@aa
